### Test 5: GET all enrollments (should return empty array)
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
X-Training-User: admin@tms.com

### Test 6: POST create enrollment (should return 201 with Location header)
POST {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Training-User: admin@tms.com

{
  "studentId": "S-001",
  "courseCode": "CS-101"
}

### Test 7: GET enrollment by id (replace {id} with actual id from POST response)
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/{id}
X-Training-User: admin@tms.com

### Test 8: DELETE enrollment (replace {id} with actual id)
DELETE {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/{id}
X-Training-User: admin@tms.com

### Test 9: GET deleted enrollment (should return 404)
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/{id}
X-Training-User: admin@tms.com

